          {
            "readme_said": "sudo bin/hw-smi --help / sudo bin/hw-smi --bars (run with sudo)",
            "actually_needed": "Works without sudo on this box (no GPU, so only CPU/RAM metrics); README itself says it also works without sudo, sudo only matters for some Intel GPU counters.",
