          },
          {
            "readme_said": "sudo bin/hw-smi --help",
            "actually_needed": "--help prints the option list and then 'Press Enter to continue.' and waits for input; with stdin closed it did not exit (killed after 60 s, exit 137). Under timeout with SIGINT it continued into the monitor display instead of exiting, so it is not a clean non-interactive check.",
            "kind": "readme_wrong"
          },
          {
            "readme_said": "hw-smi --bars / --graphs / --log are run interactively",
            "actually_needed": "Both --bars and --graphs run until Enter/Ctrl+C; tested with timeout --preserve-status -s INT. Output is a continuous screen redraw.",
            "kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "readme_said": "writes all telemetry data into a file hw-smi-YYYY-DD-MM-hh-mm-ss.log located next to the hw-smi executable",
            "actually_needed": "File written in bin/ next to the executable, named hw-smi-2026-11-16-05-15-54.log style: the date order is YYYY-MM-DD, not YYYY-DD-MM as the README says. The --help text says the file is hw-smi.log.",
            "kind": "readme_wrong"
          },
          {
            "readme_said": "Prerequisites: g++, ocl-icd-opencl-dev (and GPU drivers)",
            "actually_needed": "For a build with no GPU driver found, make.sh compiled with plain g++ -std=c++17 -O3 and no OpenCL headers were needed; the box has no root so ocl-icd-opencl-dev was not installed. GPU driver support could not be built or tested here.",
            "kind": "note"
          }
